<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 16:46:25 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>独家：Ineffable Intelligence 增加了六名“联合创始人”，聘请了来自 Google DeepMind、InstaDeep 和风险投资公司 Flying Fish 的资深人士</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/ineffable-intelligence-hires-cofounders-hiring-google-deepmind-instadeep-flying-fish/</link><description>这家估值 50 亿美元的初创公司希望使用 DeepMind 在游戏人工智能领域取得突破时所采用的相同方法来构建超级智能。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/98228cda-dcbe-47b2-8cd8-c804478c5e6c-e1788773107488.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 10:35:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/ineffable-intelligence-hires-cofounders-hiring-google-deepmind-instadeep-flying-fish/</guid></item><item><title>这位亿万富翁创始人在 27 岁时就赚到了第一个 100 万美元，比沃伦·巴菲特早了 27 年。他对 Z 世代的建议：不要要求加薪，要要求股权</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/billionaire-founder-first-million-before-warren-buffett-wealth-advice-gen-z-dont-ask-for-a-raise-ask-for-equity/</link><description>Voyager Technologies 亿万富翁创始人表示，更高的薪水并不是致富之道——Z 世代应该通过谈判获得他们工作的公司的一部分&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2219047103-1-e1788456538227.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 13:46:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/billionaire-founder-first-million-before-warren-buffett-wealth-advice-gen-z-dont-ask-for-a-raise-ask-for-equity/</guid></item><item><title>安永首席经济学家警告说，人工智能的生产力繁荣可能会创造一个“赢家通吃”的经济</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/f500-digest-ai-productivity-boom-daco-jobs-report/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293173499-e1788515676689.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 10:44:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/f500-digest-ai-productivity-boom-daco-jobs-report/</guid></item><item><title>随着华尔街将预期转向美联储加息，白宫加大了对沃什央行的压力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/wall-street-hike-expectations-kevin-warsh-fed-trump/</link><description>“高利率让美国处于非常不公平的劣势，我不会允许这种情况发生！”特朗普在《真相社会》上撰文。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2277128581-e1788777630604.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 11:17:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/wall-street-hike-expectations-kevin-warsh-fed-trump/</guid></item><item><title>自 2021 年以来，典型科技领导者的薪酬上涨了 81 万美元，超过 COO、CFO 和 CIO 的总和</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/tech-pay-cto-ceo-raise/</link><description>从 2021 年到 2025 年，科技高管的薪酬中位数增长了 45%，增速快于首席执行官、首席财务官和首席运营官。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1921425719-e1788390598296.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 10:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/tech-pay-cto-ceo-raise/</guid></item><item><title>亚洲家族慈善事业比西方“更加亲力亲为”，也更加企业化</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/asian-family-philanthropy-bridgespan-report-hong-kong-jockey-club/</link><description>超过四分之三的亚洲家族慈善机构与政府合作，这与对国家感到“紧张”的西方捐助者形成鲜明对比。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2289643929-e1788683950986.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/asian-family-philanthropy-bridgespan-report-hong-kong-jockey-club/</guid></item><item><title>“未知领域”：随着每年利息支付增加至 1.25 万亿美元，40 万亿美元的美国国债变得更加丑陋</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/us-national-debt-interest-1-trillion-1991-bond-yields-scott-bessent/</link><description>上一次净利息支付如此高是在 35 年前。分析人士警告说，美国现在的情况比以前更糟。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291864969-e1788549932817.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/us-national-debt-interest-1-trillion-1991-bond-yields-scott-bessent/</guid></item><item><title>五分之一的美国人将体育博彩称为投资。对于 Z 世代来说，这个数字是其两倍，而且他们还远未达到收支平衡</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/americans-sports-gambling-investment-gen-z-75-cents-dollar-wagered/</link><description>过去人们会定期进行投注，但现在这已成为近四分之一的体育博彩玩家的日常习惯。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1321873839_a53836-e1788551012798.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/07/americans-sports-gambling-investment-gen-z-75-cents-dollar-wagered/</guid></item><item><title>顶级经济学家警告说，美国债务比看上去还要糟糕，国债收益率不断上升现在已成为“全力以赴的局面”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/us-debt-demand-warning-treasury-long-term-yields-deficit-bond-investors/</link><description>10年期国债收益率最近的异常表现实际上表明“对国债的需求比乍一看要弱”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292573256-e1788718299100.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 19:41:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/us-debt-demand-warning-treasury-long-term-yields-deficit-bond-investors/</guid></item><item><title>印尼火山岛喷发 1558架次航班取消 17万名乘客受影响</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/volcanic-island-anak-krakatau-indonesia-eruption-flight-cancelations/</link><description>喀拉喀托火山岛位于印度尼西亚爪哇岛和苏门答腊岛之间的巽他海峡，周日凌晨 3 点 53 分喷发了 30 秒，大约三小时后喷发了 16 秒。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26249277578739.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:03:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/volcanic-island-anak-krakatau-indonesia-eruption-flight-cancelations/</guid></item></channel></rss>